n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SnlODiaTrnTuwU9kZrhghs3ykia8xvZEZJz5dqCuu72l7aG2PQnrjtGQiciawIVv4G1Bv47P4uiaOtExQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           图片来源：CAFE IMPORTS\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n            关于白土庄园\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           2017年，Kyle Snider决定投资一家巴拿马小型咖啡农场。他找到了相识多年的好友兼商业伙伴Larry Kole，两人就此携手开启了一段冒险之旅。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b4ooKcbeJerqzUn15nksbjkJvqHuib7iaibT8LKYLUGHjU2w6HgdDz7F3G6X6EPmscds1cMAy1x7ELUrbMzI99EktNID7QKiaGRkUw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           迫不及待想一探究竟的二人，匆匆收拾行囊，登上了最早一班的航班。踏上地峡仅数日后，这两位合伙人便买下了相邻的一块土地，正式投身咖啡产业。为了将这片未开发的土地打造成一个可运营的咖啡种植园，他们四处请教，学习如何改良土地、培育作物，并据此制定了商业计划。他们还聘请了一位全职农场经理和配套的工作人员。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b4vYgQxU8Ju4ew3EWYfibkqoWGdD77JWbicU5Grnsskugm5Z7ia9O64kxV3kiab1wICIlUibMaSia8hrKV84dwx71JpyX42cQJcVp1XA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmecoa.qpic.cn%2Fmmecoa_jpg%2FruUhEq093b4rXARnPqaSSkpaatHfBrNYK3pcibJvvAk9YTaicE8RhYI6VGUPqpcUrD6hUw0Hic2Drnw0icCoMCaTkF00nTEVZbCUSOE3ibt6l31A%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4440253536286752773\" data-ratio=\"0.8\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4440253536286752773\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-w=\"720\">\n</iframe>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           随着时间推移，更多的机遇接踵而至，主要体现在可供开发的土地上。2018年，他们又收购了两块土地。那时，消息已逐渐传开。由于众多投资者都希望加入，他们便成立了一家姊妹公司。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b7kPt0EwpoiaiaEGdy39qxvsmuvRsmbGFR67cvIf3JNCmqVMKlibI1PExaj0Den5WoJASwSVBXoequj3rpDfWYjNC3Z2qs6zdfHVk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           过去七年间，Kyle和Larry取得了几乎难以想象的进展，在巴拿马西部六座不同的农场共拥有超过300英亩的瑰夏咖啡种植区，最高的种植海拔到2200米左右；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmecoa.qpic.cn%2Fmmecoa_jpg%2FruUhEq093b64BWldDT96m9I7VuibyazuTNb54ZeC2ILxZbJIFm7h0FR4ouKNHBI7F9HZCNm72VibgxovjGLu82vu0SxvUsVZpml6zveibbLVDE%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4440261284105289733\" data-ratio=\"1.7763157894736843\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4440261284105289733\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-w=\"1080\">\n</iframe>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            获奖记录\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Best of Panama 2024\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Gesha 水洗\n          </span>\n<a class=\"wx_topic_link\" data-topic=\"1\" style=\"color: #576B95 !important;\" topic-id=\"mn1pp685-ildj4f\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            #5\n           </span>\n</a>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", syst